NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000293 "to at least review and apply more patches.  Or the module should just be"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000294 "deprecated in favor of Net::SSH::Expect or made into an ::Any style"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000295 "compatibility wrapper that uses whatver implementation is avaialble"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000296 "(Net::SSH2, Net::SSH::Perl or shelling out like the module does now).  Please"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000297 "email Ivan if you are interested in helping."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000298 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000299 "John Harrison <japh@in-ta.net> contributed an example for the documentation."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000300 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000301 "Martin Langhoff <martin@cwa.co.nz> contributed the ssh_cmd command, and"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000302 "Jeff Finucane <jeff@cmh.net> updated it and took care of the 0.04 release."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000303 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000304 "Anthony Awtrey <tony@awtrey.com> contributed a fix for those still using"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000305 "OpenSSH v1."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000306 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000307 "Thanks to terrence brannon <tbone@directsynergy.com> for the documentation in"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000308 "the GENERATING AND USING SSH KEYS section."
